  + [source_sha256] is F200CA49FD087B486D601AB95749CA98B63D7F9246869DB417B4BE2CB2AE4C0C
  + [accepted_support] is claim identity, work-boundary projection, mailbox carrier projection, conflict review, stale claim review, human override, generated-output nonpromotion, and no-mailbox-IO proof are available as evidence
  + [accepted_limit] is IR6 does not authorize new mailbox file writing, mailbox transport, IRC/Matrix/web adapter behavior, automatic assignment, agent dispatch, operations control, or live control

  = must: import IR6 as bounded coordination evidence, not as a direct transport or dispatch layer
  = must: require P7 to restate participant and authority-class identity before extending coordination semantics

