  + [P7P9-DR10_state] is gated_until_DR09_acceptance
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty_for_DR02_planning
  + [implementation_authority_gap] is present_and_intentionally_blocked
  + [dispatch_authority_gap] is present_and_intentionally_blocked
  + [live_control_authority_gap] is present_and_intentionally_blocked

  ! [P7P9DR01VerificationSatisfied] is accepted
    @ [support] [AcceptedBoundaryInput: P6SurfaceImplementation]
    @ [support] [AcceptedBoundaryInput: CoordinationEvidence]
    @ [support] [AcceptedBoundaryInput: OperationsDryRunEvidence]
    @ [support] [AcceptedBoundaryInput: IntegratedManagerEvidence]
    @ [support] [AcceptedBoundaryInput: OperationsSafety]
    @ [support] [AuthorityClassGapInventory]
    @ [support] [P7ReadinessGapSet]
    @ [support] [P9ReadinessGapSet]
    @ [support] [DependencyClosureResult: P7P9-DR01]

& [NextSliceRecommendation: P7P9-DR02] is the recommendation after P7P9-DR01
  + [next_slice] is P7P9-DR02 participant, conversation identity, and authority class contract
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
